{"id":"nchi-2b1824","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-8a6d7be1-cc76-4660-9860-e17a6264ca82","text":"Done per spec, not committed yet. Changes:\n- `FolderLabel.short` / `FolderLabel.full` (moved out of `FolderPicker`), used by both chips. `ContextChip` shows `acme/nocchi`, with the full path as the tooltip.\n- The `notch-prompt.png` snapshot gives the primary a real folder, so the label shows up there.\n\n138 tests pass."},"created_at":"2026-10-02T08:08:34.386647Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.287 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
